---
import Page from '../../../components/Page.astro';
import { grantees } from '../../../lib/data.js';
---
<Page title="Our Grantees" section="fund" image="/images/banner-grantees.svg" alt="Illustration of students in a classroom">
  <h3>Partners in a Shared Vision</h3>
  <p>We value our grantees as partners, not simply recipients of funding. Since sharpening our focus in 2014, we have been fortunate to build partnerships with strong organizations that have shown success in our two focus areas:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Early Grades Achievement:</strong> Increasing the number of children in kindergarten through third grade who achieve on or above grade level in core subjects</li>
    <li><strong>Educators &amp; Leaders:</strong> Recruiting, developing and retaining excellent teachers and leaders in K-12 public schools</li>
  </ul>
  <ul>
    {grantees.cycles.map((c) => <li><a href={`/what-we-fund/our-grantees/${c.slug}/`}>{c.title}</a></li>)}
  </ul>
  <p>It is our privilege to invest in and learn alongside our grantees, listed by grant cycle for your review. We are proud of each partner and of their work to help every student read, learn and graduate ready for college, career and life.</p>
  <p><img src="/images/grantmaking-and-beyond.svg" alt="Grantmaking and beyond: grantmaking, convening, research and advocacy" width="900" height="380" /></p>
</Page>
